---
// Frequently Asked Questions component for Security Services
---

<section id="faq" class="bg-surface py-20 md:py-28 border-t border-gray-100" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:faq-root">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:faq-container">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:faq-header">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:faq-tagline">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-primary rounded-none inline-block" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:3nq726"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:3nq725">Got Questions?</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-[28px] leading-[36px] md:text-[40px] md:leading-[48px] font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-foreground" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:faq-heading">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[16px] text-muted-foreground mt-4 leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:faq-subheading">
        Find answers to common questions about our security guard services, deployment timelines, licensing, and customized protection solutions across Berks County and Pennsylvania.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:faq-grid">
      <div class="bg-background border border-gray-200/70 p-8 rounded-none flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:faq-card-1">
        <div data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:441qd5">
          <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-foreground mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:lfpvxm">
            What types of security services does M&amp;G Security offer?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[15px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:xxprpy">
            We provide comprehensive security solutions including apartment complex security, construction site protection, public auctions, festivals, sporting events, concerts, high school functions, after-hours restaurant monitoring, and licensed private investigations.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-background border border-gray-200/70 p-8 rounded-none flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:faq-card-2">
        <div data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:441qd6">
          <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-foreground mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:lfpvxn">
            Are your security guards and investigators licensed and insured?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[15px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:xxprpx">
            Yes. M&amp;G Security, owned and operated by KRE Security LLC, is fully licensed, bonded, and insured in the Commonwealth of Pennsylvania. Our personnel undergo thorough background investigations and rigorous professional training.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-background border border-gray-200/70 p-8 rounded-none flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:faq-card-3">
        <div data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:441qd7">
          <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-foreground mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:d21403">
            How quickly can you deploy security personnel for an event or urgent need?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[15px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:xxprpw">
            We can accommodate both planned long-term contracts and short-notice or emergency deployments. For urgent assignments, call our direct line at (610) 562-0971 to speak immediately with our operations team.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-background border border-gray-200/70 p-8 rounded-none flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:faq-card-4">
        <div data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:441qd8">
          <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-foreground mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:d21402">
            What geographic areas do you cover?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[15px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:xxprpv">
            We primarily serve Berks County (including Reading, Wyomissing, Kutztown, Hamburg, and surrounding townships) as well as adjacent counties and communities across Eastern and Central Pennsylvania.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-background border border-gray-200/70 p-8 rounded-none flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:faq-card-5">
        <div data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:441qd9">
          <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-foreground mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:d21401">
            Can we customize security coverage hours and patrol routines?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[15px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:xxprpu">
            Absolutely. Every property and event has distinct security requirements. We tailor our staffing schedules, stationary posts, access control points, and mobile patrols to fit your exact operational requirements and budget.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-background border border-gray-200/70 p-8 rounded-none flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:faq-card-6">
        <div data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:441qda">
          <h3 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-foreground mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:d21400">
            How do I get a quote for security services?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[15px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/security-services/ServicesFAQ.astro:xxprpt">
            You can request a quote by calling us directly at (610) 562-0971, emailing jemes@kresecurity.com, or submitting our online contact form. We will review your site specifications and provide a competitive, transparent proposal.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
